Let's use the Linear API. First, I need to fetch the sub-issues of MOB-42 and find the one with a 3-point estimate and due date October 15.

Linear GraphQL API. Base URL is https://api.linear.app/graphql. Auth is handled via proxy using a placeholder token.

Let's write a query:

```graphql
query {
  issue(identifier: "MOB-42") {
    id
    title
    subIssues(first: 50) {
      nodes {
        id
        identifier
        title
        estimate
        dueDate
        priority
      }
    }
  }
}
```

After that, find the one where estimate = 3 and dueDate = 2026-10-15. Then, via issueUpdate, update the priority to High (priority 3).

